# The build context is `COPY . /app` (Dockerfile), so anything not excluded here ends up in the
# image. This file must cover at least what `.gitignore` keeps out of git (S-10): a secret that is
# safe from a commit is not safe from `docker build` run in a working copy.
# ⚠ A pattern without `**/` matches only at the root of the context.

# Dependencies and build output (installed and built inside the image).
**/node_modules
**/.bun
**/dist
**/target
bun.lockb

# Secrets: env files, credentials and the PRIVATE backup seal key.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/.secrets
**/lgr-seal.key
**/*.seal.key

# Business data: customer documents and exports, never part of the app.
**/uploads
**/uploads-test
**/*.xlsx
**/*.csv
**/ap_*.json
**/*.db

# Local tooling and test output.
.git
.claude
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
**/*.log
